# DAN: Cursor development / launch-safety rules

**When on `automation/dan-autonomous-review-loop-20261010`, begin with `docs/dan-autonomous/START_AUTONOMOUS_RUN.md`, `REVIEW_PROTOCOL.md`, and `loop_state.json`, then read the older handoff for product context.** For other existing feature branches continue to follow `docs/CURSOR_DAN_HANDOFF_20261009.md`. Always prefer latest GitHub remote state/CI logs over stale SHAs or summaries.

- Legacy feature target: `feature/dan-location-jp-launch-plan-20261009`, draft PR #31 into `feature/dan-v3-real-app-ui`. Autonomous execution target: `automation/dan-autonomous-review-loop-20261010` based on `cursor/dan-commercial-complete-e0e7`; confirm ancestry before creating/updating PR. Do **not** merge CI-proxy PR #30 to main.
